  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Life and Peace Institute&apos;s Peacebuilding program 2010-2012. LPI jobbar med civilsamh&#xe4;llet och hj&#xe4;lper konfliktcenter att          analysera och hantera komplexa konfliktdynamiker p&#xe5; olika niv&#xe5;er,     samt mobilisering av akt&#xf6;rer som kan komma att ha positiv inverkan i  deras transformationsarbete.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Life and Peace Institute&apos;s Peacebuilding Programmes        2010-2012. LPI works with civil society actors and help creates       conflict transformation centres to analyse and manage complex         conflict dynamics at different levels, as well as mobilising actors   likely to play a positive and complementary role in their             transformation/resolution.</narrative>
